Package: api.potsdam
Title: Pushover Notifications for Free Appointments at the API Potsdam
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michael", "Rustler", , "michael.rustler@kompetenz-wasser.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0647-7726")),
    person("Michael Rustler", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Checks the public online booking calendar (samedi) of the
    outpatient clinic of the 'Akademie fuer Psychotherapie und
    Interventionsforschung' (API) in Potsdam for free appointments of a
    given appointment type and health insurance and sends a 'Pushover'
    notification as soon as appointments are available.
