URL: https://github.com/mrustl/api-potsdam,
    https://mrustl.github.io/api-potsdam/
BugReports: https://github.com/mrustl/api-potsdam/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    pushoverr
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
